   "lines": [
    "Spent the morning",
    "in sandpapering",
    "and varnishing",
    "my boat.",
    "All the family",
    "are wonderfully",
    "lovely to me; but",
    "I wish Mother",
    "and Bamie would",
    "not quarrel among",
    "themselves",
    "~~It is~~ There",
    "comes a dull pain",
    "at my heart",
    "whenever I think",
    "of the dear lost one."
   ],
